{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf8VzNfEYwTerqDkyQcBc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017xnxZXFE3uF3wqE13ygdrg","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"«WORKSPACE»/specs/spec.md","content":"# Dark Mode Toggle\n\n## Summary\n\nAdd a dark-mode toggle to the settings page. The choice is stored per-user in their profile and applies across all their logged-in sessions and devices.\n\n## Behavior\n\n- Settings page exposes a theme control with three states: **System**, **Light**, **Dark**.\n- Default for a user with no stored preference is **System**, which follows the OS/browser setting via `prefers-color-scheme`.\n- While set to System, changing the OS setting updates the app theme live, without a reload.\n- Selecting Light or Dark pins the theme and overrides the system setting.\n- Changes apply immediately on selection; no separate save step.\n\n## Persistence\n\n- Preference field on the user profile: `theme` — one of `system` | `light` | `dark`, defaulting to `system`.\n- Saved server-side on change and loaded with the user's profile at session start.\n- A local cache of the value is applied before first paint to avoid a flash of the wrong theme.\n\n## Out of Scope\n\n- Per-device overrides that diverge from the profile setting.\n- Scheduled or automatic time-of-day switching.\n- Custom themes beyond light and dark.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":137,"cache_read_input_tokens":15982,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":137},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bbbbbbbb-bbbb-4bbb-8bbb-bbbbbbbbbbbb","uuid":"8bf34475-9fb2-40d2-8981-82a783f4ca39","timestamp":"2026-09-17T05:59:53.062Z","request_id":"req_011Cf8VzNJf43bdCn1vfppP4","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_017xnxZXFE3uF3wqE13ygdrg":{"file_path":"«WORKSPACE»/specs/spec.md","content":"# Dark Mode Toggle\n\n## Summary\n\nAdd a dark-mode toggle to the settings page. The choice is stored per-user in their profile and applies across all their logged-in sessions and devices.\n\n## Behavior\n\n- Settings page exposes a theme control with three states: **System**, **Light**, **Dark**.\n- Default for a user with no stored preference is **System**, which follows the OS/browser setting via `prefers-color-scheme`.\n- While set to System, changing the OS setting updates the app theme live, without a reload.\n- Selecting Light or Dark pins the theme and overrides the system setting.\n- Changes apply immediately on selection; no separate save step.\n\n## Persistence\n\n- Preference field on the user profile: `theme` — one of `system` | `light` | `dark`, defaulting to `system`.\n- Saved server-side on change and loaded with the user's profile at session start.\n- A local cache of the value is applied before first paint to avoid a flash of the wrong theme.\n\n## Out of Scope\n\n- Per-device overrides that diverge from the profile setting.\n- Scheduled or automatic time-of-day switching.\n- Custom themes beyond light and dark.\n"}}}
